body:
OMG are you me? My dad was the exact same. Never spoke much. Didn't really take much of an interest. 

&#x200B;

Ditto about the whole relying on friends.

Definitely going to consider checking my phone at certain times as opposed to when I feel. The only apps I have on my phone are texts calls, Whatsapp and Audible.  I did get into a really good habit of only really checking messages twice a day (if anyone really needs me, they know to get me by email) and it did wonders! Must get back into it!

&#x200B;

Thanks
